                                                "sense_id": "234b1f63-7ae5-3cff-b815-cffb2f321609",
                                                "text": "My boyfriend is taking media studies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db1a7a39-70fa-46c2-bfcf-30a0beb1f716",
                                                "sense_id": "234b1f63-7ae5-3cff-b815-cffb2f321609",
                                                "text": "Technology studies is not yet well established as an academic discipline in its own right but a serious body of both scholarly and popular literature in the field is now emerging."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
